&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16580908" author="ilyak" created="Wed, 15 Aug 2018 10:10:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; please review proposed test fix.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am uneasy about this since the behavior where cache store operations are cancelled by default when node is stopping seems dangerous to me. But tests it fixes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16597456" author="ilantukh" created="Thu, 30 Aug 2018 13:33:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilyak&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilyak&quot;&gt;ilyak&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
This is not a big issue and your fix looks OK. We do not store in WAL data that was read from external store using read-through mechanics.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
